<title>NEW ZEALAND: Lion Nathan 1st half result due April 28.</title>
<headline>Lion Nathan 1st half result due April 28.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lion Nathan Ltd said on Tuesday its result for the first half year to February 28 will be released on April 28.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
